1
00:00:00,921 --> 00:00:04,791
(Sheldon:)My mother warned me this is what happens
to pretty boys in the big city.

2
00:00:06,126 --> 00:00:08,256
(Penny:)No, we just want information.

3
00:00:08,429 --> 00:00:12,089
(Sheldon:)Oh. Oh, I've got that in spades. Ravage me.

4
00:00:13,734 --> 00:00:15,994
(Penny:)We heard you read the letter
from Howard's father.

5
00:00:16,170 --> 00:00:17,930
(Bernadette:)- I did.
- What did it say?

6
00:00:18,772 --> 00:00:20,262
(Sheldon:)I can't tell you that.

7
00:00:20,441 --> 00:00:24,381
I'm bound by closet organizer-organizee
confidentiality.

8
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,940
(Amy:)Sheldon, that's not a real thing.

9
00:00:28,115 --> 00:00:31,885
(Sheldon:)Neither is the rule that you have to hold
your girlfriend's hand at the movies.

10
00:00:32,052 --> 00:00:34,182
But that doesn't stop you
from pawing at me...

11
00:00:34,355 --> 00:00:37,345
(Sheldon:)...like you're a bear
and I'm a trash can full of sweets.

12
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,690
(Penny:)Why do you even care?
Just tell us what it says.

13
00:00:42,897 --> 00:00:46,227
(Sheldon:)Control over the information
contained in that letter belongs to Howard.

14
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,370
(Sheldon:)By happenstance, I came to know it.

15
00:00:48,536 --> 00:00:51,626
(Sheldon:)That doesn't give me the right
to disseminate it freely.

16
00:00:51,805 --> 00:00:55,795
(Penny:)The letter was found in Bernadette's closet.
Doesn't that count for something?

17
00:00:56,977 --> 00:01:00,307
(Sheldon:)Are you pointing out that California
is a community-property state...

